	<key>NSHealthShareUsageDescription</key>
	<string>IronSage reads your sleep, heart rate variability, resting heart rate, workout heart rate and active energy, and body weight to show your progress and suggest your next sessions.</string>
	<key>NSHealthUpdateUsageDescription</key>
	<string>IronSage saves your strength workouts and the body weight you enter to Apple Health.</string>
